"content": "<style>\nh1.thlex-title { font-size: 1.3em; margin: 0 0 0.4em; }\n.thlex-key { color: #888; font-size: 0.85em; font-weight: normal; margin-right: 0.4em; }\nnav.thlex-index { margin: 0.5em 0 0.75em; }\nnav.thlex-index ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2em; }\nnav.thlex-index li { margin: 0.15em 0; font-size: 0.95em; }\n.thlex-section { margin: 0.6em 0; }\nh2.thlex-heading { font-size: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0 0.2em; }\nh3.thlex-subheading { font-size: 0.95em; font-weight: normal; font-style: italic; margin: 0.2em 0; }\n.thlex-language-sets { margin: 0.3em 0 0.3em 1em; }\n.thlex-language-set { margin: 0.4em 0; padding-left: 0.75em; border-left: 3px solid #e0e0e0; }\n.thlex-language { font-size: 0.8em; color: #888; margin-right: 0.4em; }\n.thlex-lemma { font-weight: bold; font-family: serif; }\n.thlex-translit { color: #555; font-style: italic; font-size: 0.9em; margin-left: 0.3em; }\n.thlex-refs { font-size: 0.85em; color: #444; margin-top: 0.15em; }\n.thlex-paragraphs p { margin: 0.35em 0; font-size: 0.95em; line-height: 1.5; }\n.thlex-image { margin: 0.5em 0; display: block; }\n.thlex-image img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }\nfigcaption.thlex-caption { font-size: 0.85em; color: #555; font-style: italic; margin-top: 0.2em; }\n.thlex-abbr { border-bottom: 1px dotted #888; cursor: help; }\n.thlex-xref { color: #1a5fb4; }\ntable.thlex-table { border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.9em; margin: 0.5em 0; }\ntable.thlex-table td { padding: 0.2em 0.6em; vertical-align: top; border: 1px solid #ddd; }\ntable.thlex-table tr:first-child td { font-weight: bold; background: #f5f5f5; }\nul.thlex-index-list { margin: 0.4em 0; padding-left: 1.4em; font-size: 0.95em; line-height: 1.6; }\nul.thlex-index-list ul { margin: 0.1em 0; padding-left: 1.4em; }\n.thlex-index-key { font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; }\n</style><h1 class=\"thlex-title\" id=\"REALIA:2.5\"><span class=\"thlex-key\">2.5</span> 標題：長槍、矛（spear, lance）</h1><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">經文出處</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-sets\">\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">來： חֲנִית</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯： chanith)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09013019\" data-end-ref=\"09013019\">1SA 13:19</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09013022\" data-end-ref=\"09013022\">1SA 13:22</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09017007\" data-end-ref=\"09017007\">1SA 17:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09017007\" data-end-ref=\"09017007\">1SA 17:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09017045\" data-end-ref=\"09017045\">1SA 17:45</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09017047\" data-end-ref=\"09017047\">1SA 17:47</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09018010\" data-end-ref=\"09018010\">1SA 18:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09018011\" data-end-ref=\"09018011\">1SA 18:11</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09019009\" data-end-ref=\"09019009\">1SA 19:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09019010\" data-end-ref=\"09019010\">1SA 19:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09019010\" data-end-ref=\"09019010\">1SA 19:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09020033\" data-end-ref=\"09020033\">1SA 20:33</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09021009\" data-end-ref=\"09021009\">1SA 21:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09022006\" data-end-ref=\"09022006\">1SA 22:6</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09026008\" data-end-ref=\"09026008\">1SA 26:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09026012\" data-end-ref=\"09026012\">1SA 26:12</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09026016\" data-end-ref=\"09026016\">1SA 26:16</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09026022\" data-end-ref=\"09026022\">1SA 26:22</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09026022\" data-end-ref=\"09026022\">1SA 26:22</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10001006\" data-end-ref=\"10001006\">2SA 1:6</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10002023\" data-end-ref=\"10002023\">2SA 2:23</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10002023\" data-end-ref=\"10002023\">2SA 2:23</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10021019\" data-end-ref=\"10021019\">2SA 21:19</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10023007\" data-end-ref=\"10023007\">2SA 23:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10023018\" data-end-ref=\"10023018\">2SA 23:18</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10023021\" data-end-ref=\"10023021\">2SA 23:21</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10023021\" data-end-ref=\"10023021\">2SA 23:21</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10023021\" data-end-ref=\"10023021\">2SA 23:21</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"12011010\" data-end-ref=\"12011010\">2KI 11:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13011011\" data-end-ref=\"13011011\">1CH 11:11</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13011020\" data-end-ref=\"13011020\">1CH 11:20</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13011023\" data-end-ref=\"13011023\">1CH 11:23</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13011023\" data-end-ref=\"13011023\">1CH 11:23</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13011023\" data-end-ref=\"13011023\">1CH 11:23</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13012035\" data-end-ref=\"13012035\">1CH 12:35</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13020005\" data-end-ref=\"13020005\">1CH 20:5</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"14023009\" data-end-ref=\"14023009\">2CH 23:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18039023\" data-end-ref=\"18039023\">JOB 39:23</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18041018\" data-end-ref=\"18041018\">JOB 41:18</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19035003\" data-end-ref=\"19035003\">PSA 35:3</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19046010\" data-end-ref=\"19046010\">PSA 46:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19057005\" data-end-ref=\"19057005\">PSA 57:5</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23002004\" data-end-ref=\"23002004\">ISA 2:4</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"33004003\" data-end-ref=\"33004003\">MIC 4:3</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"34003003\" data-end-ref=\"34003003\">NAM 3:3</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"35003011\" data-end-ref=\"35003011\">HAB 3:11</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">來： רֹמַח</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯： romach)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04025007\" data-end-ref=\"04025007\">NUM 25:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"07005008\" data-end-ref=\"07005008\">JDG 5:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"11018028\" data-end-ref=\"11018028\">1KI 18:28</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13012009\" data-end-ref=\"13012009\">1CH 12:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13012025\" data-end-ref=\"13012025\">1CH 12:25</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"14011012\" data-end-ref=\"14011012\">2CH 11:12</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"14014007\" data-end-ref=\"14014007\">2CH 14:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"14025005\" data-end-ref=\"14025005\">2CH 25:5</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"14026014\" data-end-ref=\"14026014\">2CH 26:14</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"16004007\" data-end-ref=\"16004007\">NEH 4:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"16004010\" data-end-ref=\"16004010\">NEH 4:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"16004015\" data-end-ref=\"16004015\">NEH 4:15</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24046004\" data-end-ref=\"24046004\">JER 46:4</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"26039009\" data-end-ref=\"26039009\">EZK 39:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"29004010\" data-end-ref=\"29004010\">JOL 4:10</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">來： שֵׁבֶט</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯： shevet)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10018014\" data-end-ref=\"10018014\">2SA 18:14</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希： γαῖσος</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯： gaisos)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\">JDT 9:7</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希： δεξιολάβος</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯： dexiolabos)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44023023\" data-end-ref=\"44023023\">ACT 23:23</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希： δορά, δόρυ</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯： dora, doru)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\">JDT 7:10, JDT 11:2, ESG 8:12, SIR 29:13, 3MA 3:15, 3MA 5:43, 3MA 6:5</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希： κάμαξ</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯： kamax)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\">2MA 5:3</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希： κέντρον</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯： kentron)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\">4MA 14:19</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希： λόγχη</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯： logchē)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43019034\" data-end-ref=\"43019034\">JHN 19:34</data>, 2MA 5:2, 2MA 15:11</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希： σιβύνη</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯： sibunē (zibunē))</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\">JDT 1:15</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Latin</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">拉： framea</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\">2ES 13:9, 2ES 13:28</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">描述</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>在一根長而直的桿棒上面安裝一個銳利的尖端，就做成了長槍，主要攻擊方式是刺。槍桿的粗細略小於人手的虎口長度，長度差不多是一個人的身高或者更長。槍桿一般木製，配上金屬槍頭或槍尖（參<a class=\"thlex-xref\" data-bnType=\"lexiconLink\" data-collection=\"\" data-key=\"\" href=\"#\">2.5.1 槍頭 (spearhead)&lt;REALIA:2.5.1&gt;</a> ）。槍的尾端（槍纂）也用金屬包裹，帶尖（參<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10002023\" data-end-ref=\"10002023\">2SA 2:23</data> ），可以用來把槍戳在地上，或者用作刺棒來驅趕牲畜。</p>\n<p>參<a class=\"thlex-xref\" data-bnType=\"lexiconLink\" data-collection=\"\" data-key=\"\" href=\"#\">2.3.1 鞘 (sheath, scabbard)&lt;REALIA:2.3.1&gt;</a> 中的插圖。</p>\n<hr/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">用途</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>打仗時，持槍的人握著槍桿的中間部位，用力刺向敵人，只偶爾用拋擲的方式來攻擊對方（參<a class=\"thlex-xref\" data-bnType=\"lexiconLink\" data-collection=\"\" data-key=\"\" href=\"#\">2.6 投槍、標槍、短槍 (javelin)&lt;REALIA:2.6&gt;</a> ）。</p>\n<hr/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">翻譯</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>翻譯者在選擇字詞或短語時，應該盡量表明槍是一種用手握持和用來戳刺的武器（就像一柄固定在棍棒末端的刀那樣使用），而不是通過投擲來傷敵。</p>\n<p>短語「舉起他的槍」出現在<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10023018\" data-end-ref=\"10023018\">2SA 23:18</data> 和<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13011011\" data-end-ref=\"13011011\">1CH 11:11</data> 。譯作「他持槍作戰」（<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"Good News Translation (1992)\">GNT</abbr> 直譯）意思是正確的。</p>\n<p>希臘文<em>dexiolabos</em> 在<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44023023\" data-end-ref=\"44023023\">ACT 23:23</data> 的意思不能確定，大多數譯本將其譯成「長槍手」（“spearmen”；<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"Revised Standard Version (1952)\">RSV</abbr> 、<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"New International Version (1984)\">NIV</abbr> ）、「持槍的歩兵」（“foot soldiers with spears”；<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"Contemporary English Version\">CEV</abbr> ）、「持槍的人」（“men with spears”；<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"New Century Version\">NCV</abbr> ），或「輕裝備部隊」（“light-armed troops”；<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"Revised English Bible (1989)\">REB</abbr> ）。</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
